                        "entry_id": "cbe06f9f-4f69-3ad8-9006-2a4c52000866",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A leisurely meal between lunch and dinner in the late afternoon or early evening (about 3-5 p.m.), usually instead of lunch or dinner."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "informal",
                            "rare"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
